# Copy this file to .env in the same directory and paste one key per line.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# .gitignore excludes .env, so no key reaches the repository, the Dataverse
# deposit or the shell history file. Every command in this package reads .env
# at import, so a key is typed once and works in every terminal.
#
# A line with no value after the equals sign is ignored.
#
# Where each key is issued:
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY  openrouter.ai  ->  Keys  ->  Create key. Serves all six
#                       confirmatory models. Set a credit limit when creating the
#                       key, so the key cannot spend past the limit.
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   console.anthropic.com  ->  API keys. Needed only to rerun
#                       the Stage A pilot on Claude Haiku 4.5.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
